      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Pick up any object with either the grip trigger or index trigger.


        For
        Touch Plus controllers: Use the index trigger pressure (squeeze the index
        trigger at the end of travel).


        For Touch Pro controllers: Use the
        thumb rest pressure to squish and break objects (press on the thumb rest).


        For
        Touch controllers, use the A/X buttons.'
